  "step_3": "The decision reason requires evaluating the maximum magnitude outcome (2500 vs 2400) and weighting it by its probability (0.33 vs 0.34). The individual does not consider the maximum magnitude or its weighted value. Instead, the individual focuses solely on the increase in probability (from 33% to 34%), which is a different consideration. Therefore, the individual did not apply the decision reason. The information considered by the individual (probability increase) does not match the required information (weighted maximum magnitude outcome). The justification (favoring higher probability) does not align with the rule of the decision reason (weighting maximum outcome by probability). Thus, the decision reason was not used.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
